kakaotalk-debian-wrapper (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Bundled Wine 11.0 (wow64, no i386 packages needed), built on Ubuntu 22.04.
  * Wine patch: ignore stale mouse move/resize requests so windows no longer
    stick to the pointer after dragging (KWin and others).
  * Supports both the classic KakaoTalk and the new Qt 6 based KakaoTalk.
  * Korean font substitution, DPI and input method (fcitx/ibus) setup.
  * Desktop entry, icon extracted from the user's install, kakaotalk:// links,
    optional autostart.

 -- kakaotalk-debian-wrapper contributors  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:30:00 +0900
